  "articleBody": "While minor cosmetic garage repairs can be simple, a full structural conversion quickly crosses into territory requiring licensed general contracting. \n\nSignals it's time to bring in professional support:\n- You need to frame out the overhead door opening and tie it into the exterior envelope weather-tight.\n- The layout requires cutting into load-bearing walls for new egress windows or entry doors.\n- The project involves coordinating multiple trade permits across framing, electrical circuits, and plumbing extensions.\n- You are raising floor levels or dealing with uneven, sloping concrete slabs that require moisture mitigation.\n- The city requires code-compliant fire separation walls between the conditioned area and utility zones.\n\nWhen Professional Guidance Helps: Handling sub-trades and sequencing inspections takes experienced management so your project passes building reviews the first time. Working with an owner-operated team ensures your framing, drywall, and finish carpentry stay on schedule.\n\nReady to transform your garage into functional living space? Call HH Remodeling LLC at 303-505-0866 to schedule an on-site consultation with Abraham.",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-23"
}